 e Fastest Bicycle is a story of perseverance\, as the team tackle a missin
 g bike\, high speed crashes\, members departures\, serious design flaws an
 d injury. It’s also an exploration of community\, as they discover that th
 eir competitors can also be their greatest allies.\n\nStarring: Mike Burro
 ws\, Chris Boardman\, Francois Pervis\, Karen Darke\, Ilona Pelletier\, To
 dd Reichert\n\nFilm release at Merlin Cinemas Redruth\nBook tickets: /film
